      ],
      "text": "Koder is an experimental, open-source terminal AI coding assistant in Python (3.10+), MIT-licensed, in alpha status, combining a streaming TUI, persistent sessions, goals, scheduled loops, skills, MCP, sandbox-aware permissions, and multi-agent workflows."
    },
