      ],
      "text": "Runtime state is stored locally: SQLite sessions and transcripts in ~/.koder/koder.db, goals, memories, settings, OAuth tokens under ~/.koder/tokens/, and team state under ~/.koder/ and project .koder/ paths; sessions are not uploaded to a Koder-hosted service."
