      ],
      "text": "Agents with isolation: worktree frontmatter run in their own git worktree under .koder/worktrees/; empty worktrees are auto-removed and ones with uncommitted work are kept, with SubagentStart/Stop and WorktreeCreate/Remove hook events."
    },
