      "text": "Skills are local instruction bundles loaded on demand from .koder/skills/ or ~/.koder/skills/ as SKILL.md files with frontmatter including name, description, and allowed_tools; plugins can contribute skills, commands, MCP servers, channels, and dependencies."
    },
